          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.8.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 8:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ageno swa Wac Manyen Maber, rupiri obedo meni pa Were ma botho ji je ma joyeyo, marapena Joyuda, aka nyaka Jopath bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAB.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hab 2:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Wac Manyen Maber nyutho paka Were ketho ji i tiro gine luwo kwoŋ yeyo, wok i cakirok tundo i gike. Ato randik waco ni, “Ŋat'okethi i tiro gi Were bino kwo gi yeyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Reco pa dhano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were otieko nyutho ni keme pere bino wok i polo to lwenyo gi reco je kodi tim pa ji mareco ma royo pajo mareco geŋo adieri ŋeyirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were miyo jo gir'acula rupiri gima ji jonyalo ŋeyo kwoŋ Were nitie kamaler rijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok cuka Were cwey piny, kada go won kinenere i meni pere ma cil gi cil kodi i kite ma nyawerewere, gima nyutho ni go nitie nenere i gigipiny ma go ocweyo. Am'omiyo dhano ongoye kodi gigoŋirok! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.17+EPH.4.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efeso 4:17-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji joŋeyo Were, to jokimiy go dwoŋ pere, kendo kada temo foyo go ni walwa. Kucel, paro pajo olokere masisiri aka paro pajo ma kitiy m'odoŋ mudho otieko poŋ'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowaco ni joriek, to kere jomiŋ ayin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.16+DEU.4.17+DEU.4.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 4:16-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kama di jolami Were makitho, jolamo rigin gim'othedhi i cal pa dhano ma tho, kosa apa winyin, kosa ap'ogwaŋe kosa apa thwole ayino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
