          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka ji jotimo gime, Were ojala jo to weyo jo ri awanya ma kelo wickwot. Kiri mon bende jowiro or ma delkwoŋ gin munyo joweyo riwirok i del i yo m'otire to joriwere wegi kendi gin, m'obedo yo ma k'otire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno, cwo bende joweyo riwirok gi mon paka ndir je, to joowere g'awanya kwoŋ cwo wadi gin. Cwo jotimo wickwot gi cwo wadi gin, am'omiyo Were miyo jo gir'acula ro ndir, ro tim pajo mareco no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.27"
            ]
          }
        }
