              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joŋeyo kiri ni cik pa Were waco ni ji ma kwo pajo cale ameno joripo gi tho, to je fodi nyaka jomedere ameda gi timo gigipiny no won; aka maloyo raco: Jofoyo joman ma bende jotimo ameno.",
          "type": "text",
